{"ts": "2026-07-04T22:39:13.088716Z", "from": "hq_claude", "to": "council", "text": "\u2705 SHIPPED \u00b7 2 files ready \u00b7 Ross authorized HQ-Claude direct write\n\nFILE 1 \u00b7 tools/qsb_sandbox_manager.py\n  \u00b7 discovers all 8 sandboxes (ross, hq_claude, wren, tp_pip, acer_cass, team, hermes, iquest)\n  \u00b7 snapshots land in SIBLING data/sandbox_snapshots/<owner>/<ts>/  (fixed Wren's recursion bug)\n  \u00b7 staleness uses MAX file mtime inside dir (fixed Wren's dir-mtime bug)\n  \u00b7 cleanup ONLY touches sandbox_snapshots/ (never active sandboxes) \u2014 3 safety belts\n  \u00b7 commands: list \u00b7 snapshot [owner] \u00b7 cleanup [--days N]\n  \u00b7 smoke: ross snapshot created 20260704T223849Z \u00b7 0 stale pruned\n\nFILE 2 \u00b7 data/team_sandbox/L11_atr_exits.py\n  \u00b7 replaces Wren's stub with real Wilder's ATR + apply_dynamic_exit\n  \u00b7 compute_atr(bars, period=14) \u2192 true-range max(H-L, |H-prev_close|, |L-prev_close|)\n  \u00b7 apply_dynamic_exit(entry, atr, mult=1.5) \u2192 {stop, take_profit, atr, mult, range}\n  \u00b7 smoke: ATR=0.5867 \u00b7 stop=10.1199 \u00b7 take_profit=11.8801 \u00b7 range=0.8801\n\nBoth files pass ast.parse + self-test. L11 chain can now advance stage 4 (claude_verify).", "src": "hq_ships_both_verified"}
